    the toggle is read by the controller's GPIO 22 on `ZEROIZE_SW`, the only listener: `ZEROIZE_HW` reaches test points on B16 and D8 and A22's pull-up `R117`, and no hardware line reaches the slots, the supervisors or the drives.
