    names: boards=PCB-B
V2-SPEC.md#Compute, storage, expansion (B16, about 330 x 200 mm; the distributed fabric of 32.52):L34:cell:1:s1 [63d017d3ba]
    Firmware and provisioning, no board change (the toggle is sensed on C7 alone since `faf8c981`, with a buffer onto the ribbon line; correction 19); precondition: an erasable slot map on the fitted ATECC608B, closed at desk from Microchip's public documents by `feasibility/ZEROIZE.md` (two key-encryption keys, both destroyed) and owed on the bench (the full datasheet stays under NDA), the SLB 9673 TPM 2.0 the fallback.
    names: refs=C7; boards=C7; gates=buffer
