ASSEMBLY.md#9:L224:item:s1 [cd9739a701]
    Case and face (**Corrected 27 September 2026 (MESHSAT-1357, the case set C1 to C6):** C1 to C6): the four setting legs with their VHB 5952 pads, the printed locator and the two pairs of printed wedges; the connector plate (114.0 x 68.3 x 5.0) and its gasket with its receptacles on the back wall, each on a Glenair 930-001 silicone flange gasket, the six M4 x 25 plate screws with bonded sealing washers; the twelve PolyPhaser GTH-SFF-AL arrestors on the two 6.0 mm RF entry plates with their two gaskets and sixteen M4 x 12 ISO 7380 screws on rubber-faced sealing washers (in place of the eleven Amphenol 132170 couplers at Z 88); the sensor pod on its M8; ten 6-32 UNC x 1/2 in A2 pan heads for the plate (in place of the M3 x 10 with star washers); the face seals and hardware of `vendor/seals/` and `vendor/mentor/`: the e-paper tape frames from `face-plate.dxf` (the PORON ring is dropped, C1), the 2.0 mm UV polycarbonate lens with 3M Primer 94, three Silex GP60 silicone washers, the NKK AT516 spare O-ring and AT428H boot, the APEM K seals, the Floyd Bell 61663 gasket, sixteen Mentor 1282.5004 light guides, eight PEM SO-M3-10 standoffs and two S-M3 nuts, the Xenarc window gasket, DOWSIL 3145 clear for the beads, MG Chemicals 422B for the backer's underside, the 3M 7871EC serial label; the QMX tray r2 (the printed tray and retaining frame, the 5052 lid plate, ten M3 x 5 countersunk A2, six M3 x 10 button head A2 with six M3 square nuts, two PORON 4701-30 pads, DP8005 for the plate, bonded tie mounts for the lid harness).
    names: refs=C1,C6; boards=C6,the backer
